# Authors

Modula is written and maintained by:

  Adrian De Leon  <https://github.com/adriandeleon>

Contributions are welcome. Add yourself here in the same form when you send one.


# Third-party work

Modula bundles or depends on work by others; NOTICE names each with its licence.
Two deserve mention here because they shape what Modula is:

  librtlsdr and the Osmocom project — the RTL-SDR driver Modula talks to. It is
  the system's own library, reached at runtime, and is not bundled.

  IBM  — IBM Plex Mono, the typeface, under the SIL Open Font License. Every
  number in the interface is set in it, and its tabular digits are the reason
  the readouts do not shift as they change.
